{"seconds": 37.6, "exit": 0, "final": "After Kh2, Black has Qxg3+ as well. So the main line is **1...Nxf2+ 2.Kg2 Qxg3+ 3.Kf1 Qg1#** with checkmate.\n\n---\n\n**Best move:** Nxf2+\n\n**Main line:** Nxf2+ Kg2 (best try; Kh4 Qxg3+ also wins; Kh2 Qxg3+ also wins) Qxg3+ Kf1 Qg1#\n\n**Motif:** fork\n\n**Coaching note (80 words):**\nThe knight on g4 and queen on d6 are perfectly coordinated to hunt the exposed king on h3. When you spot an attacked, undefended piece like the f2 pawn, check if capturing it gives check\u2014this knight fork forces the king into a dangerous position. After Nxf2+ and the forced king moves, your queen delivers the final blow with Qxg3+ and Qg1#. Always scan for forcing moves (checks and captures) that exploit an exposed enemy king!\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxf2+\", \"line\": [\"Nxf2+\", \"Kg2\", \"Qxg3+\", \"Kf1\", \"Qg1#\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19", "move": "Nxf2+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19", "move": "Qxg3+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp1n1/1QN1P1PK/PP2BP2/R1B5 b q - 0 19", "move": "Qh6+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp3/1QN1P1PK/PP2Bn2/R1B5 w q - 0 20", "move": "Kg2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r3k3/pp4p1/2nq4/5p2/3Pp3/1QN1P1PK/PP2Bn2/R1B5 w q - 0 20", "move": "Kh4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen":